      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُخَالَطٌ</span></b>  (tropical:)  <i>Infected, corrupted, disordered,</i> or <i>confused, in his intellect;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُخْتَلِطٌ</span></b> : (TA:)
or <i>mad; insane;</i> or <i>affected by diabolical possession.</i> (TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لبس</span>.)

